    "created_at": "2022-09-27T03:36:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-27T03:36:41Z",
    "body": "I have a fix. Basically we'll just stop using `data-fill-with=\"\"` and instead use a non-data attribute, `grammar-fill=\"\"` or similar. And then strip them all out in post-processing to keep the document valid.\r\n\r\nI'll work on a couple PRs.",
